20
00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.880
Cioè, perdo, vado verso la morte.

21
00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:50.030
Quando comincio ad andare verso l'osteoporosi,

22
00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.494
